# Parallax worker — copy to ".env" and adjust. Placeholders only (no real secrets).
#
# --- Phase 1 (optional; defaults match README / uvicorn CLI) ---
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# PORT=8000
#
# --- Model loading (required for inference; set before starting the worker) ---
# MODELS_DIR=/path/to/your/comfyui/models
# CHECKPOINT_FILENAME=your_checkpoint.safetensors
#
# --- Inference output (required for txt2img; defaults to /tmp/parallax-output) ---
# OUTPUT_DIR=/path/to/your/output/directory
#
# --- Later phases (placeholders; uncomment when wiring integration) ---
# GATEWAY_CALLBACK_URL=https://your-gateway.example/worker/done
# WORKER_PUBLIC_URL=http://your-worker-host:8000
# INFERENCE_API_KEY=your-api-key-placeholder
